    "body": "> For context, here are some issues with discussions and resolutions about having both sync beforetoggle and async toggle events: [openui/open-ui#342](https://github.com/openui/open-ui/issues/342) [openui/open-ui#578](https://github.com/openui/open-ui/issues/578) And here is one about naming of the events: [openui/open-ui#607](https://github.com/openui/open-ui/issues/607)\r\n\r\nThanks. Wasn't aware of those tickets.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/openui/open-ui/issues/342 states that \"beforetoggle\" is acceptable but not necessary when hiding a popover. Didn't fully read https://github.com/openui/open-ui/issues/578 yet.",
